{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3xLmuk1TFsYD2XUEav","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me.*\n\n*I am ancient oak, iron-banded, set deep into stone. My keyhole is a single dark eye, watching you.*\n\n*A cold draft breathes through me from the other side.*\n\n*You said \"key.\"*\n\n*But you have not inserted one.*\n\n*I remain locked.*\n\n🔒\n\n*The keyhole waits. What do you have?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":93,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}